WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.672
Just a little more.

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:10.093
Just a bit more...

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:15.682
I've nearly got it...

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:18.935
Levius...

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:30.530
Then go grasp it. As tightly as you can.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:36.703
And now, the sixth round!
This is the final round!

00:00:48.965 --> 00:00:50.508
A-Awesome...

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:54.304
They must be
far past their limits already...

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:56.473
It's exactly the same.

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.183
What is?

00:00:58.475 --> 00:01:00.602
The way they fight.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.863
Back! He'll head-butt!

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:14.908
No, he's not about to break the rules now.

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:15.825
Huh?

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:21.331
Malcolm's searching too,
in this fight with Levius.

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:22.916
For something.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:36.262
This is the end.

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:25.937
Your winner, Levius Cromwell!

